  "Il Wirtschaftswunder è il miracolo economico degli anni Cinquanta e Sessanta.":"The Wirtschaftswunder is the economic miracle of the 1950s and 1960s.",
  "Il miracolo economico (Wirtschaftswunder)":"The economic miracle (Wirtschaftswunder)",
